WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Set up your account — teaching your agents who you are

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1 of 4 — Enter your website and we'll prefill your details for you

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Rather type it yourself? Use "Skip, I'll fill it manually"

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 2 of 4 — Company information, already filled in from your site

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Check it over and fix anything we got wrong — industry, size, country, timezone

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then press Next

7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Step 3 of 4 — Company identity: what you do, and the problem you solve

8
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Pick the brand tone your agents answer in

9
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Add the emails support should come from

10
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Step 4 of 4 — The agents ask a few questions. It usually takes five minutes

11
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Answer in the chat, or upload the document instead

12
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:26.000
That's your account set up
